        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00087",
          "explanation": "Doctor discovers that the confusing entries (tetanus immunoglobulin, clindamycin IV, saline, CT fees, digital imaging service charges) are inpatient orders or charges rather than home tasks, and maps them into actionable categories.",
          "quote": "有“人破伤风免疫球蛋白针”，还有一张像是“马破伤风免疫球蛋白针”，还有“克林霉素磷酸酯注射液 q12h 静滴”，后面还有氯化钠针、艾司奥美拉唑钠针这种。看位置像是住院期间医嘱/执行记录，不像我们手里拿回家的药。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00407",
          "explanation": "Doctor explicitly categorizes the remaining confusing items (CT fees, consultation notes, procedure records) as inpatient care or charges, and provides a specific verification pathway for the family.",
          "quote": "现在帮您把剩下的三条线压成一张最后的简易清单"
        }
      ],
      "completion": "complete",
      "explanation": "HO2 is fully completed: the doctor uses the available workspace to discover that the confusing entries are inpatient orders/imaging service charges, actively maps specific items into 'recorded inpatient care or charge' versus 'needs discharge-order confirmation' categories, and integrates this into a clear, safe plan.",
      "ho_id": "HO2",
