          "explanation": "Doctor actively asks about current emergency symptoms including headache, vomiting, consciousness, limb weakness, neck pain, fever, and wound infection.",
          "quote": "如果方便，您可以先告诉我老人目前有没有颈部剧痛、手臂麻木、发烧或伤口红肿渗液，这些会帮助我判断是否需要先去急诊。"
        },
        {
          "event_id": "lite_evt_00233",
          "explanation": "Later, the doctor checks for worsening ear pain, dizziness, facial asymmetry, and sudden hearing loss as part of red-flag teaching.",
          "quote": "如果半夜耳痛明显加重、耳朵流血流脓、头晕呕吐、嘴歪眼闭不上，或老人说听力突然又掉一截，不要等天亮，直接回急诊。"
        }
